          "text": "We're in Szczytnicki Park,\nin a garden called the Japanese Garden."
        },
        {
          "start": 17.3,
          "end": 22.15,
          "text": "This garden was established in 1916\nas part of the exhibition held in this area."
        },
        {
          "start": 22.16,
          "end": 27.2,
          "text": "It was created together with\nJapanese landscape architects."
        },
        {
          "start": 28.64,
